# Sanity Studio (Sam's product panel) is a single-page app of its own under /admin.
# Its deep links (/admin/structure/product/...) must get the studio's index.html, not the site's.
/admin/* /admin/index.html 200

# SPA fallback: deep links (/catalog, /new-arrivals, refreshes) serve the app.
# Real files (including /admin/static/*) are served before redirects are evaluated.
/* /index.html 200
